# Traffic Sign Detection Using Deep Learning

## Project Description
This project develops a traffic sign image classification system using a Convolutional Neural Network (CNN). It processes traffic sign images and classifies them into different traffic sign categories.

## Project Objectives
- Load and explore the traffic sign dataset.
- Preprocess and resize images.
- Visualize traffic sign classes and dataset characteristics.
- Build and train a CNN model.
- Evaluate the model using classification metrics and a confusion matrix.
- Save the trained model for future use.

## Dataset
The project uses traffic sign image data organized into training, testing, and metadata files.

Dataset files used in the notebook:
- `Train.csv`
- `Test.csv`
- `Meta.csv`
- `Train/`
- `Test/`
- `Meta/`

The metadata describes 43 traffic sign classes.

